\import{macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}

\taxon{Definition}
\title{Deduplication operator}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{pretraining}
\tag{data}

\p{Let #{\mathcal M_{\rm doc}} be the set of finite multisets of documents.
A \newvocab{deduplication operator} is a map
##{
D:\mathcal M_{\rm doc}\longrightarrow\mathcal M_{\rm doc}
}
that selects retained representatives according to a declared duplicate
relation. The relation may compare complete documents or spans.}

\p{The declaration includes normalization, similarity threshold, cluster
construction, and representative tie-breaking. Different choices can remove
different training events even when they report the same duplicate rate.}
